          "observation": "notice.stateReadDisplayedCount"
        },
        {
          "equals": 1,
          "observation": "notice.totalDisplayedCount"
        }
      ],
      "id": "changed-failure-details-same-category-no-extra",
      "prerequisites": [
        "状态读取类别消息已实际显示一次。",
        "同一状态读取功能的底层错误细节发生变化。"
      ],
      "profileId": "local-fault-notices",
      "requirements": [
        "GKSA-14"
      ],
      "steps": [
        "在状态读取类别已提示后把底层错误细节从缺失变为异常。预期：归入同类且不重复提示。检查：state.readException=true 且 notice.stateReadDisplayedCount=1。",
        "观察总数。预期：总显示次数不变。检查：notice.totalDisplayedCount=1。"
      ],
      "title": "同一功能的不同底层错误归入同类且不重复提示"
    },
    {
      "category": "dedup",
      "evidence": {
        "log": true,
